OL,3,GNEWSAConservationists hopeful for
OL,4,Acorncrake comeback
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservationists trying to reintroduce
OL,7,Fthe corncrake to Yorkshire say they're
OL,8,F"very hopeful" the rare bird could once
OL,9,Fagain flourish in the county.
OL,11,FOver the summer, a number of
OL,12,Fcaptivity-reared corncrakes have been
OL,13,Freleased into the wild as part of the
OL,14,Feffort to re-establish the population.
OL,16,FCraig Ralston, senior reserve manager
OL,17,Ffor Natural England's Lower Derwent
OL,18,FValley National Nature Reserve, said he
OL,19,Fwas "excited" about the possible return
OL,20,Fof the bird.
